-- companies seed — initial 391-row Israeli tech market database.
--
-- Source: research pass (May 2026) from a PDF of ~530 Israeli tech
-- companies + LLM enrichment + web-search verification for ~25
-- additions in under-represented sectors. Foreign companies that
-- snuck through the Israel-suffix filter, acquired/absorbed
-- companies, and unverifiable entries were dropped.
--
-- Confidence: only HIGH + MEDIUM rows included (391 of 475 enriched).
-- LOW rows (placeholder defaults for unverified companies) excluded;
-- can be added later via manual curation if needed.
--
-- Stage normalisation: Series D / E / F / G all collapsed to 'Growth'.
-- Source attribution: all rows set to source='research' (added to
-- CHECK constraint in 20260513_companies_source_research.sql).
--
-- This is a single-shot data migration. Domain values are not UNIQUE
-- in the companies table by design (per the original schema decision
-- to allow duplicates and dedupe later), so re-running this migration
-- would insert duplicates. Guard against accidental re-run by checking
-- if the seed has already landed before re-applying.

